+# Signal Engine integration
+
+The website does not scrape retailer pages. It consumes the shared FateDrop Signal Engine V1 API so the website, app and Discord can all use the same lifecycle record.
+
+Set server-side variables:
+
+```env
+FATEDROP_SIGNAL_ENGINE_URL=http://localhost:8787
+FATEDROP_SIGNAL_API_TOKEN=...
+```
+
+The authenticated `/alerts` page reads `/v1/signals` through the server-side proxy at `/api/signals`. The token never enters client JavaScript.
+
+Lifecycle states are supplied by the engine:
+
+- Whisper — catalogue evidence before verified availability.
+- Manifested — verified purchasable state.
+- Vanished — previous purchasable state disappeared.
+- Echo — a previously available product returned.
+
+If the engine is unavailable, the Alerts page displays an explicit disconnected state and no fake signals.
